// with the checked state of the containers. The arrow keys move the focus and the selection
// within the group without wrapping, Tab enters the group at the selected button, and Ctrl
// with an arrow key moves the focus only. The template is the control theme of the WinUI theme
// (`Controls/RadioButtons.xaml`, from WinUI's `RadioButtons.xaml`), with the parts
// `PART_HeaderPresenter` and `PART_ItemsPresenter` (WinUI's `HeaderContentPresenter` and the
// `ItemsRepeater` `InnerRepeater`); the theme sets the items panel, a
