// resources `RadioButtonsColumnSpacing` and `RadioButtonsRowSpacing`. The Fluent and Simple
// themes have no template for it (docs/porting/winui-controls.md, section 5.1). The exclusive
// check is the radio button group manager's: the containers are the logical children of the
// group and have no group name, so checking one unchecks the others. The group itself only
// checks the container of a new selection, and unchecks the container of the old one when no
// container is checked instead (a cleared selection, or one whose container is not realized),
// which the group manager never does (WinUI's `Select` writes both containers). Missing
